  "solution": {
    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;is the event in which the&nbsp;top side of the die shows blue colour<br /><math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi></math> (Let)<br />Probability of getting a blue colour at least twice<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow></mrow><mn>8</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow></mrow><mn>8</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>7</mn></msup><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>p</mi></mfenced><mn>1</mn></msup></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math>",
